flowchart LR
  M1[Home region merchants] --> G[Global traffic steering]
  M2[Other eligible cohorts] --> G
  G --> A1[Active API Mumbai]
  G --> A2[Active API Hyderabad]
  A1 --> L1[(Mumbai shard/ledger owner)]
  A2 --> L2[(Hyderabad shard/ledger owner)]
  L1 <-->|Partitioned ownership only; no cross-writes| L2
  A1 -. events .-> K1[(Kafka Mumbai)]
  A2 -. events .-> K2[(Kafka Hyderabad)]
  K1 -. async replicate .-> K2
  K2 -. async replicate .-> K1
  N[Global idempotency / merchant ownership registry] --> A1
  N --> A2
  C[Risk: partition and ownership conflict] -. requires fencing and reconciliation .-> L1
